 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\n大阪商事株式会社                                              MASTER SERVICES\n港区芝浦1-2-3, 530-0001 大阪市, Japan                                  AGREEMENT\n登録番号: T6905915968452\n\n発行元                                                               請求先\n大阪商事株式会社                                                     東京精密機器株式会社\n港区芝浦1-2-3                                                        中央区銀座4-5-6\n530-0001 大阪市                                                     530-0001 大阪市\nJapan                                                                Japan\nVAT: T6905915968452\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026年02月19日 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween 大阪商事株式会社, with its registered office at 港区芝浦1-2-3, 大阪市 (\"Party A\"), and 東京精密機器株式会社, with its\nregistered office at 中央区銀座4-5-6, 大阪市 (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\nParty A    大阪商事株式会社 / 田中太郎\nParty B    東京精密機器株式会社 / 鈴木花子\nDate       2026年02月19日",
